      "id": "q_001",
      "question": "Where did Josiah Rowe (b. ~1828, Ohio) reside between 1850 and 1865, and with whom was he living?",
      "rationale": "Primary research objective. The tree places Josiah in Vigo County, Indiana at his death in 1879 and gives Ohio as his birthplace, but nothing is documented between his birth and his 1862 enlistment. No records have been searched yet.",
